{"seq":1,"slug":"inspection-type-timing-model","title":"检验类型与时机节点模型：DUPRO、PSI 与 CLS 的定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/psi-timing-stage/inspection-type-timing-model","wordCount":2730,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"检验类型与时机节点模型-dupro-psi-与-cls-的定位\">检验类型与时机节点模型：DUPRO、PSI 与 CLS 的定位</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-检验-测试与监装是三件不同的事\">核心概念：检验、测试与监装是三件不同的事</h2><p>在跨境采购里，&quot;验货&quot;这个词被滥用得很厉害，导致供应商、买家、第三方机构三方对同一份报告的理解对不上。先把三个动作拆开：**检验（inspection）**是人对成品做抽样、目视与功能核对，判据是缺陷；**测试（testing）**是实验室对材料或成品做破坏性/非破坏性测量（拉伸、燃烧、化学迁移、EMC），判据是数值是否落在标准区间；**监装（supervision）**是在装柜现场核对数量、唛头、封条并留证，判据是&quot;装进去的是不是检验通过的那批、封条有没有断&quot;。</p>\n<p>这三者的输出物、判定语言、责任边界都不同。本 hub 处理的是<strong>检验与监装</strong>这条线——它靠抽样与判据，而不是靠仪器读数。材料的合规测试、实验室资质与报告互认属于第三方测试与实验室合规体系，检验报告不能替代测试报告，测试报告也不能替代成品抽检：一个批次可能材料合格（测试过）却因装配缺陷被判退（检验不过）。</p>\n<p>检验类型按<strong>发生时刻</strong>分成四种，业界通用缩写是 IPC、DUPRO、PSI、CLS。它们的区别不在于&quot;检查什么&quot;，而在于<strong>在哪一个生产完成度上取样本</strong>——样本所在的生产阶段决定了你能多早发现系统性问题，以及返工窗口还剩多少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类检验节点的定义与触发时点\">四类检验节点的定义与触发时点</h2><p>四个节点的命名与触发时机在主要第三方机构（QIMA、SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、TÜV Rheinland 等）的产品目录里高度一致，差别只在措辞：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>典型触发时点（生产完成度）</th>\n<th>主要目的</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>发现缺陷的返工窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IPC</td>\n<td>Initial Production Check（初始生产检查）</td>\n<td>生产启动后、完成度约 0–20%</td>\n<td>核对来料/零部件与首件，验证工艺参数已到位</td>\n<td>首件报告、来料核对</td>\n<td>最大，几乎可全批返工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DUPRO</td>\n<td>During Production Inspection（生产中期检查）</td>\n<td>完成度约 20–60%（常见取 20–40%）</td>\n<td>在批量铺开时捕获系统性缺陷，避免整批报废</td>\n<td>中期报告、偏差预警</td>\n<td>中等，可挑出前段并在后段纠正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PSI</td>\n<td>Pre-Shipment Inspection（出货前检验，又称 FRI 最终随机检验）</td>\n<td>100% 生产完成、且通常 ≥80% 已包装</td>\n<td>终态判定：这批货能不能走</td>\n<td>终检报告、AQL 判定</td>\n<td>最小，常只剩局部返工或改期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS</td>\n<td>Container Loading Supervision（监装/装柜监督）</td>\n<td>装柜进行中</td>\n<td>确认装的是合格批、数量唛头封条一致</td>\n<td>监装报告、封条号</td>\n<td>不适用（属证据保全）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条容易被忽略的行业约定，直接决定了节点是否成立：其一，<strong>PSI 必须在 100% 生产完成后再做</strong>——如果只做了 80% 就去看，抽样框（lot universe）不完整，被抽到的样本代表不了整批，判定在统计上无效；机构通常要求&quot;全部成衣/成品已生产且大部分已包装&quot;才受理。其二，<strong>样本必须来自同一个检验批（inspection lot）</strong>：同一订单、同一 SKU、同一产线、同一时间窗、同一批原料。跨产线合并成&quot;一个批次&quot;送检，会把产线间的方差混进去，AQL 判定随即失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时机决策模型-什么时候插入-dupro-什么时候只保留-psi\">时机决策模型：什么时候插入 DUPRO，什么时候只保留 PSI</h2><p>节点不是越多越好，每个节点都是一笔人天费加一次停工。选择的核心变量是<strong>生产周期长度、批量、缺陷可返工性、是否首次合作</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[拿到生产排期与出货节点] --&gt; B{生产周期是否&lt;br/&gt;短于 5 个工作日}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[只保留 PSI&lt;br/&gt;跳过或合并 DUPRO]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{是否首次合作&lt;br/&gt;新工厂或新模具}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[IPC + DUPRO + PSI]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[PSI 为基线&lt;br/&gt;按风险加 DUPRO]&#10;    E --&gt; G{是否整柜出运&lt;br/&gt;或客户要求监装}&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[CLS 监装并记录封条号]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[散货或快递&lt;br/&gt;以 PSI 影像为终态证据]&#10;    H --&gt; J[出具报告与批次处置结论]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[拿到生产排期与出货节点] --&gt; B{生产周期是否&lt;br/&gt;短于 5 个工作日}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[只保留 PSI&lt;br/&gt;跳过或合并 DUPRO]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{是否首次合作&lt;br/&gt;新工厂或新模具}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[IPC + DUPRO + PSI]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[PSI 为基线&lt;br/&gt;按风险加 DUPRO]\n    E --&gt; G{是否整柜出运&lt;br/&gt;或客户要求监装}\n    F --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; G\n    G --&gt;|是| H[CLS 监装并记录封条号]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[散货或快递&lt;br/&gt;以 PSI 影像为终态证据]\n    H --&gt; J[出具报告与批次处置结论]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>这套逻辑里最有工程价值的一条是<strong>返工窗口约束</strong>：PSI 只有在&quot;发现问题后还有时间返工&quot;时才有意义，否则它退化成一份事后追责的文书。可用的安全余量由下式给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ETD</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{ETD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ETD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预计离港/交运日：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>PSI</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>ETD</mtext><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>rework</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>reinspect</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T*{\\text{PSI}} \\le T*{\\text{ETD}} - \\left( T*{\\text{rework}} + T*{\\text{reinspect}} + T\\_{\\text{buffer}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSI</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ETD</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rework</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reinspect</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为返工时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>reinspect</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{reinspect}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reinspect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为返工后的复检占用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为排队与报告出具缓冲。若这个不等式在日历上无解（例如生产本身压到出货前三天），正确动作不是&quot;硬做 PSI&quot;，而是<strong>把节点前移</strong>——补 DUPRO 或把 PSI 提前到包装前，用中期检验换取返工时间。这是&quot;检验时机&quot;问题里最常被做反的一步。</p>\n<p>同理，DUPRO 的完成度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 不该拍脑袋。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 越小越接近 IPC（发现问题早，但样本还不能反映稳定工艺）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越接近 PSI（样本典型，但返工代价高）。工程上的推荐区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0.4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\in [0.2,\\,0.4]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 来自一个权衡：此时工艺已跑顺、缺陷模式已显现，而剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的批次仍可在产线上被纠正，不必整批重做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽样与判定-aql-把-时机-翻译成-能不能放行\">抽样与判定：AQL 把&quot;时机&quot;翻译成&quot;能不能放行&quot;</h2><p>时点决定样本从哪来，**AQL（Acceptable Quality Limit，可接受质量限）**决定样本怎么判。AQL 的定义是&quot;仍被视为可接受的最差过程平均（以百分比或比率表示）&quot;，缺陷通常分三级：<strong>致命（critical）</strong>（安全/法规，常取 AQL 0，即零接受）、<strong>主要（major）</strong>（影响功能或可售性）、<strong>次要（minor）</strong>（外观，不影响功能）。判据来自计数抽样表：ISO 2859-1（国际主版本为 1999 版，含 2011 修正案）、中国的等同采用标准 GB/T 2828.1-2012，以及北美体系的 ANSI/ASQ Z1.4（2008 版起把 AQL 解释为 &quot;acceptance quality level&quot;，含义不变）。</p>\n<p>判定流程是：按批量查<strong>样本量字码</strong>，再按 AQL 查<strong>接收数 Ac / 拒收数 Re</strong>。以通用检验水平 II、单次抽样、正常检验为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>批量区间</th>\n<th>样本量字码</th>\n<th>样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>AQL 1.0 (Ac/Re)</th>\n<th>AQL 1.5 (Ac/Re)</th>\n<th>AQL 2.5 (Ac/Re)</th>\n<th>AQL 4.0 (Ac/Re)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1,201–3,200</td>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>125</td>\n<td>3 / 4</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3,201–10,000</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>5 / 6</td>\n<td>7 / 8</td>\n<td>10 / 11</td>\n<td>14 / 15</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消费品的常见组合是&quot;致命 0、主要 2.5、次要 4.0&quot;；对安全敏感或高价值品类收紧到主要 1.5 甚至 1.0。判定本身是一个二项接受概率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>accept</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P*{\\text{accept}}(p) = \\sum*{i=0}^{Ac} \\binom{n}{i} p^{i} (1-p)^{\\,n-i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accept</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1247em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条曲线解释了为什么&quot;时点&quot;和&quot;抽样&quot;必须一起谈：AQL 只在<strong>样本来自完整的合格批次</strong>时才成立。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>、AQL 2.5 时 Ac=10，意味着一批真实不良率为 2.5% 的货约 95% 概率被接收（生产者风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>）；而要让误收概率降到约 10%（消费者风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta \\approx 0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span>）所需的真实不良率（即极限质量 LQ）显著高于 AQL。任何提前于 100% 完工、或跨产线拼批的做法，都让这条本已不宽的曲线失去意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败模式-时机错位比判据错更常见\">失败模式：时机错位比判据错更常见</h2><p>检验项目的失败很少出在&quot;AQL 选错数&quot;，而多出在时机上。几个高频反模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PSI 前置到未完工阶段</strong>：为了赶船期，在 70% 完成度就抽检，抽样框不完整，报告合法但不成立，船到港后开箱暴雷。</li>\n<li><strong>把 DUPRO 当 PSI 用</strong>：用中期报告直接作出货放行依据，等于用未定型批次的结论背书终态。</li>\n<li><strong>跳过整改复检</strong>：PSI 判拒后直接重开一单，未做复检确认整改有效，缺陷按&quot;漏检&quot;重新流入。</li>\n<li><strong>监装与检验脱节</strong>：CLS 只数柜数，不核对装柜的货是不是那份 PSI 通过批，出现&quot;抽检合格的样品被换货、柜里装的是另一批&quot;的调包。</li>\n<li><strong>批次定义随意</strong>：把不同产线、不同班组混成一个送检批，样本方差被稀释，通过率高但不可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与法规和强制项目的接口\">与法规和强制项目的接口</h2><p>时机节点不只是买家的内部选择，它也挂在几条外部程序上，这些程序会直接指定&quot;必须做哪一类检验、在哪一点做&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>政府符合性评定（VOC）项目</strong>：尼日利亚 SONCAP、肯尼亚 PVoC、沙特 SASO/SABER 等，要求在出口国由指定机构（SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、Cotecna 等）完成符合性检验并出具证书，通常绑定在<strong>出货前</strong>这个节点，与 PSI 时间窗重合。</li>\n<li><strong>欧盟市场监管与产品安全</strong>：Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 确立市场监督与合规框架，GPSR（General Product Safety Regulation (EU) 2023/988，自 2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用）要求可追溯性与技术文件留存。检验报告在其中的作用是<strong>留存合规证据</strong>，而非替代 CE/UKCA 的自我声明或公告机构认证。</li>\n<li><strong>平台与买家合同</strong>：大型零售商与平台的自有验厂/验货条款会把 PSI 与 CLS 写成出货放行的前置条件，AQL 与节点由合同锁定，此时&quot;时机&quot;是契约义务而非可选项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>成本口径上，第三方检验在东亚与东南亚的人天费常见区间为<strong>约 USD 200–400 / 人天</strong>（含差旅及加急、周末出勤则更高，具体以各机构公开价目与合同为准）。这决定了节点设计是一个经济问题：多插一个 DUPRO 是买保险，过早 PSI 则是把保险费花在了无效的抽样上。用期望值看，一个检验节点的价值约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>收益</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>批次不合格</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>批次</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>检验</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{收益}] \\approx P(\\text{批次不合格}) \\times V*{\\text{批次}} - C*{\\text{检验}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收益</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">批次不合格</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">批次</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检验</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当返工窗口、批次价值与不良概率三者共同支撑时，这个节点才值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把检验时机讲清楚，只需回答三个问题：<strong>样本从哪个完成度取</strong>（IPC / DUPRO / PSI / CLS）、<strong>取到的样本能不能代表整批</strong>（批次完整性与干净抽样框）、<strong>判完之后还剩多少返工时间</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>PSI</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ETD</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>reinspect</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{PSI}} \\le T_{\\text{ETD}} - (T_{\\text{rework}} + T_{\\text{reinspect}} + T_{\\text{buffer}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PSI</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ETD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reinspect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。AQL 是判定语言，但它只在时点与批次定义正确时才可信；PSI 是终态判定，但没有返工窗口的 PSI 只是一份追责文书。当上面的不等式在日历上无解时，问题就转成了预约与提前期——<a href=\"inspection-booking-lead-time-window\">检验预约与提前期窗口</a> 处理机构排期、加急与时间窗的硬约束；<a href=\"onsite-reschedule-abort-exception\">现场异常、改期与中止处理</a> 则覆盖到场后生产未完工、样本不足等必须改期或中止的场景。抽样方案本身——样本量字码如何选、单次与多次抽样如何取舍、致命/主要/次要三级如何配比——属于 AQL 抽样方案章节。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检验类型与时机节点模型：DUPRO、PSI 与 CLS 的定位","id":"检验类型与时机节点模型-dupro-psi-与-cls-的定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：检验、测试与监装是三件不同的事","id":"核心概念-检验-测试与监装是三件不同的事"},{"level":2,"text":"四类检验节点的定义与触发时点","id":"四类检验节点的定义与触发时点"},{"level":2,"text":"时机决策模型：什么时候插入 DUPRO，什么时候只保留 PSI","id":"时机决策模型-什么时候插入-dupro-什么时候只保留-psi"},{"level":2,"text":"抽样与判定：AQL 把\"时机\"翻译成\"能不能放行\"","id":"抽样与判定-aql-把-时机-翻译成-能不能放行"},{"level":2,"text":"失败模式：时机错位比判据错更常见","id":"失败模式-时机错位比判据错更常见"},{"level":2,"text":"与法规和强制项目的接口","id":"与法规和强制项目的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"报检预约与提前期窗口：从完工申报到验货排期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/psi-timing-stage/inspection-booking-lead-time-window"}}